    title: "Re-exec the unified binary"
    lede: "The entry point launches the same aiperf image in a hidden execution mode over stdio. Process isolation is achieved without a second product executable: the protocol-v2 self-exec boundary is the only handoff."
    narration: "The entry point launches the same aiperf image in a hidden execution mode over stdio. Process isolation is achieved through the protocol-v2 self-exec boundary, not a second executable."
